ctober 12, 2013 and October 14, 2013, Kirkland and Goodwin Procter finalized t\n[B0671|PG41] Between October 8, 2013 and October 14, 2013, Kirkland and counsel for Moab negotiated \n[B0672|PG41] On October 14, 2013, the Special Committee held a meeting via teleconference to discuss\n[B0673|PG41] Following the adjournment of the Special Committee meeting, a meeting of the Mac-Gray B\n[B0674|PG41] Later in the day, on October 14, 2013, the merger agreement was executed, the Pamplona \n[B0675|PG41] On October 15, 2013, before the U.S. stock markets opened, Mac-Gray and CSC jointly ann\n[B0676|PG41] 41\n[B0677|PG42] Table of Contents\n[B0678|PG42] Reasons for the Merger and Recommendation of our Board of Directors\n[B0679|PG42] Reasons for the Merger\n[B0680|PG42] In the course of reaching its decision to approve the merger and the merger agreement, \n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"560:[B0559|PG27] Background of the Merger\n681:[B0680|PG42] In the course of reaching its decision to approve the merger and the merger agreement, the Special Committee and the full Board of Directors held numerous meetings and consulted with the Transaction Committee, our senior management, Goodwin Procter and BofA Merrill Lynch, reviewed a significant amount of information and considered a number of factors, including the following factors:\n[B0559|PG27] Background of the Merger\n[B0560|PG27] Background of the Merger.\n[B0561|PG27] The Mac-Gray Board of Directors, whom we sometimes to refer to as the Board, and Mac-Gr\n[B0562|PG27] Certain potential strategic transactions have been discussed from time to time between \n[B0563|PG27] As part of its ongoing review of strategic alternatives, at an in-person meeting of the\n[B0564|PG27] On April 8, 2013, representatives of BofA Merrill Lynch, as instructed by the Board, te\n[B0565|PG27] On May 9, 2013, the Mac-Gray Board of Directors held a regularly sc