te, knowingly facilitate or knowingly encourage any inquiries'),\\n ('nonsol2','immediately cease and terminate any existing solicitation'),\\n ('fid','if Mac-Gray receives an unsolicited bona fide acquisition proposal in writing from a third party after the date of the merger agreement'),\\n ('fid2','if, prior to the adoption of the merger agreement by Mac-Gray stockholders, Mac-Gray receives an unsolicited bona fide acquisition proposal in writing from a third party that did not result'),\\n ('cond1','The obligations of Parent and Merger Subsidiary, on the one hand'),\\n ('cond2','The obligations of Parent and Merger Subsidiary to consummate the merger are subject to the satisfaction of other conditions'),\\n ('cond3','The obligation of Mac-Gray to consummate the merger is subject to the satisfaction of the additional following conditions'),\\n ('fees1','Mac-Gray will pay to Parent the $11 million Mac-Gray termination fee'),\\n ('fees2','Parent will pay Mac-Gray the $15 million Parent termination fee'),\\n ('va','The persons signing voting agreements have agreed'),\\n ('vadef','\\\"Voting Agreements\\\" means collectively'),\\n ('opin','We understand that Mac-Gray Corporation, a Delaware corporation'),\\n ('q1','If the merger is completed, each share of Mac-Gray common stock that you hold'),\\n ('q2','The record date for the special meeting is November 27, 2013'),\\n ('projrev','Management Financial Projections without Acquisitions'),\\n ('projrev2','Management Financial Projections with Acquisitions'),\\n ('revenue','Total Revenue $ 333'),\\n ('ebitda','EBITDA(1) $ 71'),\\n ('eps','GAAP Earnings per share(2) $ 0.80'),\\n ('capex','Capital Expenditures(3) $ 42'),\\n ('revenue2','Total Revenue $ 344'),\\n ('ebitda2','EBITDA(1) $ 75'),\\n ('eps2','GAAP Earnings per share(2) $ 0.90'),\\n ('capex2','Capital Expenditures(3) $ 59'),\\n]\\nfor name, a in anchors:\\n    found=False\\n    for l in lines:\\n        if a in l:\\n            print(name, '=>', l[:110]); found=True; break\\n    if not found: print(name, '=> NOT FOUND')\\nEOF\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824724694,"end":1789824726920}}}}
