d; CSC’s owner). Buyer chai\n45 | 5. Counts and auction screen | \n46 | Method | Ledger-derived figures use SUMIFS over Count (column Q) filtered by What happened (D), Pro\n47 | Metric | Ledger-derived value (formula)\n48 | Confidentiality agreements (Process 1) | =SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q:$Q,'Deal ledger'!$D:$D,\"NDA signed\",'Deal ledger'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")\n49 | First contacts | =SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q:$Q,'Deal ledger'!$D:$D,\"Contact\",'Deal ledger'!$P:$P,\"Yes\")+SUMIF\n50 | Parties approached | (no ledger sum — 50 is not a Count row)\n51 | Round 1 bidders | =SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q:$Q,'Deal ledger'!$D:$D,\"Bid\",'Deal ledger'!$F:$F,1,'Deal ledger'!\n52 | Round 2 bidders | =SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q:$Q,'Deal ledger'!$D:$D,\"Bid\",'Deal ledger'!$F:$F,2,'Deal ledger'!\n53 | Round 3 bidders | =SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q:$Q,'Deal ledger'!$D:$D,\"Bid\",'Deal ledger'!$F:$F,3,'Deal ledger'!\n54 | Round 4 bids | =SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q:$Q,'Deal ledger'!$D:$D,\"Bid\",'Deal ledger'!$F:$F,4,'Deal ledger'!\n55 | Non-submissions | =SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q:$Q,'Deal ledger'!$D:$D,\"Did not submit\",'Deal ledger'!$P:$P,\"Yes\"\n56 | Exclusivity drops | =SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q:$Q,'Deal ledger'!$D:$D,\"Dropped by target\",'Deal ledger'!$P:$P,\"Y\n57 | Auction screen | Met\n58 | Per-stage balance (Process 1) | Participants stock = entrants − stated exits − inferred exits + re-entries. R1: 20 − 16 (r\n59 | 6. Comparability and inputs | \n60 | Other-scope proposals | None observed: every recorded proposal concerned the whole company’s equity. No segment, a\n61 | Consideration structure | All proposals were all-cash except Party B’s 09/18/2013 package: $19.00 cash at closing pl\n62 | Projections and benchmarks | Management projections prepared June 2013 for 2013–2018 (Without Acquisitions and With Acq\n63 | Stated inputs | Shares outstanding 14,758,306 as of the 11/27/2013 record date; merger consideration $21.2\n64 | Labelled conversion | Implied equity value ≈ $313.6M = 14,758,306 × $21.